  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> used to perform <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations by executing appropriate\n         Redis commands; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - 用于通过执行适当的 Redis 命令来执行 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 操作的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>defaultCacheConfiguration</code> - <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> applied to new <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a> by\n         default when no cache-specific <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> is provided; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>defaultCacheConfiguration</code> - 当未提供特定缓存的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>时，默认应用于新创建的<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a>；该值不得为 null。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if either the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> or <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>\n          are null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果给定的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> 或 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Allows <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>cache</code></a> creation at runtime.",
      "translation": "支持在运行时创建<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>cache</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Additionally, an initial <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> will be created and configured using the associated\n<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> for each <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named</code></a> <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> in the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此外，对于给定 Map 中的每个命名 RedisCache，将使用关联的 RedisCacheConfiguration 创建一个并配置初始 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> initialized with the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> and a default\n<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> along with an optional, initial set of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache names</code></a> used to create\n<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a> on startup.",
      "translation": "创建一个使用给定的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> 和默认 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> 初始化的新 <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>，以及一个可选的初始 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>缓存名称</code></a> 集合，用于在启动时创建 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis 缓存</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> initialized with the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> and a default\n<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>, and whether to allow <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> creation at runtime.",
      "translation": "创建一个使用给定的<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>和默认<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>初始化的新<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>，以及是否允许在运行时创建<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>unmodifiable Map</code></a> containing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>caches name</code></a> mapped to\nthe <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>configuration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>不可变 Map</code></a>，其中包含对<caches name</code></a>的映射，该映射指向\n<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 的 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>配置</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache names</code></a> to <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> objects as the initial set of\n<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a> to create on startup.",
      "translation": "获取一个将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 映射到 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> 对象的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache names</code></a>，作为启动时创建的初始 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a> 集合。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
