    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> using given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> and default\n<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>.",
