      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory method returning a Builder used to construct and configure a <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>\ninitialized with the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>.",
