      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a reference to the configured <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> used to perform <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations, such\nas reading from and writing to the cache.",
      "translation": "返回一个对配置的<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>的引用，该对象用于执行<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>操作，例如从缓存中读取和写入数据。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory method returning a Builder used to construct and configure a <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "工厂方法返回一个构建器，用于构建和配置<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a> are allowed to be created at runtime.",
      "translation": "确定是否允许在运行时创建<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的类\"><code>RedisCaches</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>initialCacheNames</code> - optional set of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache names</code></a> used to create <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis caches</code></a>\n         on startup. The default <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> will be applied to each cache.",
      "translation": "<code>initialCacheNames</code> - 可选的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>缓存名称</code></a>集合，用于在启动时创建<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>Redis 缓存</code></a>。每个缓存将应用默认的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> used by the <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> to acquire\n         connections to Redis when performing <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>connectionFactory</code> - 由 <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 使用的连接工厂，供 <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> 在执行 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 操作时获取与 Redis 的连接；该值不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if the given <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果给定的 <a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection 中的接口\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>allowRuntimeCacheCreation</code> - boolean specifying whether to allow creation of undeclared caches at runtime;\n         true by default. Maybe just use <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration.defaultCacheConfig()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>allowRuntimeCacheCreation</code> - 布尔值，指定是否允许在运行时创建未声明的缓存；默认为 true。或许可以直接使用 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration.defaultCacheConfig()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Caches</code></a> requiring a different <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>cache configuration</code></a> than the\n<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>default cache configuration</code></a> can be specified via\n<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.html#withInitialCacheConfigurations(java.util.Map)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.withInitialCacheConfigurations(Map)</code></a> or individually using\n<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.html#withCacheConfiguration(java.lang.String,org.springframework.data.redis.cache.RedisCacheConfiguration)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.withCacheConfiguration(String, RedisCacheConfiguration)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "需要不同于<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>默认缓存配置</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Caches</code></a>，可以通过<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.html#withInitialCacheConfigurations(java.util.Map)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.withInitialCacheConfigurations(Map)</code></a>指定，或者使用<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.html#withCacheConfiguration(java.lang.String,org.springframework.data.redis.cache.RedisCacheConfiguration)\"><code>RedisCacheManager.RedisCacheManagerBuilder.withCacheConfiguration(String, RedisCacheConfiguration)</code></a>单独配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/CacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a> creates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>caches</code></a> on first write, by default. Empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>caches</code></a> are not\nvisible in Redis due to how Redis represents empty data structures.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/CacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a> 会在首次写入时创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>caches</code></a>。由于 Redis 表示空数据结构的方式，空的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>caches</code></a> 在 Redis 中不可见。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
