    {
      "source": "Factory method used to construct a new <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> initialized with the given\n<a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> and using <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>defaults</code></a> for caching.\n<dl>\n<dt>locking</dt>\n<dd>disabled</dd>\n<dt>batch strategy</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"BatchStrategies.html#keys()\"><code>BatchStrategies.keys()</code></a></dd>\n<dt>cache configuration</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration.defaultCacheConfig()</code></a></dd>\n<dt>initial caches</dt>\n<dd>none</dd>\n<dt>transaction aware</dt>\n<dd>no</dd>\n<dt>in-flight cache creation</dt>\n<dd>enabled</dd>\n</dl>",
      "translation": "工厂方法用于构建一个新的<a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a>，该管理器使用给定的<a href=\"../connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a>进行初始化，并采用<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>defaults</code></a>作为缓存配置。\n<dl>\n<dt>锁定</dt>\n<dd>已禁用</dd>\n<dt>批处理策略</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"BatchStrategies.html#keys()\"><code>BatchStrategies.keys()</code></a></dd>\n<dt>缓存配置</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration.defaultCacheConfig()</code></a></dd>\n<dt>初始缓存</dt>\n<dd>无</dd>\n<dt>事务感知</dt>\n<dd>否</dd>\n<dt>飞行中缓存创建</dt>\n<dd>已启用</dd>\n</dl>",
      "count": 1
